from pathlib import Path
from PIL import Image,ImageDraw
import json,base64,io,html
D=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
for view in ['cafe-square-y030','cafe-square-y210','office-front-y030','office-front-y210','trough-detail-y210','office-plant-detail-y030']:
 sheet=Image.new('RGB',(1440,310),'#f7f4ec');draw=ImageDraw.Draw(sheet)
 for i,tag in enumerate(['before','paving','foliage']):
  p=D/tag/('today-day-'+view+'.png');im=Image.open(p).convert('RGB');im.thumbnail((480,270));sheet.paste(im,(480*i,32));draw.text((480*i+8,9),{'before':'Baseline: ivory field','paving':'Paving only: flags / tile4','foliage':'Paving + 3 selective foliage placements'}[tag],fill='#17302f')
 sheet.save(D/(view+'-comparison.png'))
parts=['<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>075 provisional integration</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;max-width:1440px;margin:28px auto;background:#f7f4ec;color:#17302f}img{width:100%;height:auto}p{max-width:1000px}table{border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #aaa;text-align:left}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.warn{padding:16px;background:#efe2c7}a{color:#146878}</style><h1>075 · provisional paving and selective foliage</h1><p class="warn">G-3a remains BLOCKED: 59 &gt; 58. Review only. Foliage default-off, no production acceptance, release, player batch or Air run. All camera variants use pinned plan 0.5.6/world 1c38f7e6/walk f3eafbcc. A fresh tram/HQ review is separate below.</p><p>Left: existing civic restyle. Middle: only the two civic plots changed to existing DK_Pave_Flags at tile4. Right: the same paving plus three explicit render-only foliage substitutions. Zoom14, pitch38, yaws30/210. Detail frames zoom3/4. Full-resolution originals are retained in before/, paving/, foliage/.</p>']
for p in sorted(D.glob('*-comparison.png')):
 im=base64.b64encode(p.read_bytes()).decode();parts.append('<h2>'+html.escape(p.stem.replace('-',' '))+'</h2><img src="data:image/png;base64,'+im+'">')
parts.append('<h2>Added geometry by selected group</h2><p>Only substitutions are counted in this chart, not visibility, draw calls, overdraw or GPU time.</p><svg viewBox="0 0 900 160" role="img" aria-label="Added triangles: trough 8940, one bed tuft 1851, cypress 0"><text x="0" y="25">1 trough: +8,940 triangles</text><rect x="270" y="7" width="530" height="24" fill="#227c7c"/><text x="0" y="75">1 bed tuft: +1,851 triangles</text><rect x="270" y="57" width="110" height="24" fill="#227c7c"/><text x="0" y="125">1 cypress: +0 triangles</text><line x1="270" y1="107" x2="270" y2="131" stroke="#227c7c" stroke-width="3"/></svg>')
j=json.loads((D/'comparison.json').read_text());parts.append('<table><tr><th>All LODs / inactive included</th><th>Baseline / paving</th><th>Selective foliage</th></tr>')
for k in ['rendererCount','meshTrianglesAllLODsIncludingInactive','materialSlotsAllLODs','shadowCastingRendererCount','alphaClippedRendererCount']:
 parts.append(f'<tr><td>{k}</td><td>{j["counts"]["paving"][k]:,}</td><td>{j["counts"]["foliage"][k]:,}</td></tr>')
parts.append('</table><p>All 14 core comparator checks pass. The final three placements also pass imported production-envelope containment at 1 mm tolerance. Three other tufts were excluded for expansion at their current placement headings; larger attempted studies remain under rejected-six/ and excluded-four/. Colliders, nav, placement transforms and original trough/trunk geometry are unchanged; only selected foliage plus its logged material batches differ. The actual built Cypress baseline already has 5,004 triangles, unlike Vela’s coarse-source 1,488 figure: its candidate is also 5,004. Do not claim that source estimate as the Unity delta. Two formerly baked placements gain a renderer, so material/shadow work can rise.</p><h2>Review observations and limits</h2><p>The flags and seafoam inlays remain readable in the four play views. The terrace’s own floor is unchanged. Shrub leaf edges read more richly at close range; the large rounded blooms still read bulky, and the shrub is dark/mottled with bright leaf-edge highlights. The cypress is dark in the office shadow; no strong obvious white alpha halo appears in these stills. Shimmer, moving alpha edges and normal continuity in motion are untested. No GPU timing/overdraw acceptance is claimed; another project ran a Unity video job during this round, making Studio timings unsuitable for a settled comparison. Potted topiary, palms and embedded planting remain open.</p><p><a href="comparison.json">Comparison manifest</a> · <a href="placements.json">Exact three placements</a> · <a href="steps.json">Commands/results</a> · <a href="inputs-before.json">Pinned input hashes</a> · <a href="README.md">Handoff and blockers</a></p>')
# Embed swap thumbnails when available; full PNGs remain beside the report.
shots=list((D/'swap').glob('tram-*.png'))+list((D/'swap').glob('district-*.png'))
if shots:
 parts.append('<h2>Recovered tram / HQ / Sphere · provisional captures</h2><p>The audit still reports 38 level hits and 597 over-bed hits, mainly imported setts/rail-edge ground. 105 unreadable meshes limit the audit. This is evidence of remaining work, not a tram acceptance.</p>')
 for p in sorted(shots):
  im=Image.open(p).convert('RGB');im.thumbnail((1200,675));b=io.BytesIO();im.save(b,format='JPEG',quality=86);parts.append('<h3>'+html.escape(p.name)+'</h3><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,'+base64.b64encode(b.getvalue()).decode()+'">')
parts.append('<h2>Tram route strip</h2>')
for p in sorted((D/'swap/strip').glob('*.png')):
 im=Image.open(p).convert('RGB');b=io.BytesIO();im.save(b,format='JPEG',quality=85);parts.append('<img alt="'+html.escape(p.name)+'" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,'+base64.b64encode(b.getvalue()).decode()+'">')
(D/'index.html').write_text('\n'.join(parts))
print(D/'index.html')
